	"html": "<div class=\"home-first-row-full-width__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-home-first-row-full-width\" class=\"region home_first_row_full_width\"><div id=\"it-block-jumbohome\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content754329e6-786a-4b74-894e-32daa796cc31\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><article class=\"align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/home_head_3.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"607\" alt=\"home header\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div></div></div></div><div class=\"home-first-row__wrapper\"><div class=\"home-first-row container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col home-first-row__col home-first-row__first\"><div id=\"it-region-home-first-row-first\" class=\"region home_first_row_first\"><div id=\"it-block-homemission\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content7c7caa75-db9a-4e57-88a8-db1b2b7f4bdb\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><h1>Our mission</h1><p>We provide citizens and companies of the Province of Prato with environmental services in the field of wastewater and liquid waste sector.</p><p>We offer wastewater recovery and distribution services, we deal with the disposing of most of the purification residues and we provide services at competitive costs.</p><p><strong>We carry out our activities respecting the environment and environmental legislation.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"home-second-row-full-width__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-home-second-row-full-width\" class=\"region home_second_row_full_width\"><div id=\"it-block-homesettori\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content0c1791ab-7095-4a75-a175-41a00b410602\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"wrapper-settore\"><h3>Our sectors</h3><div class=\"settore\"><img alt=\"icona settore\" class=\"icona-settore\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/icona-depurazione.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\" loading=\"lazy\"><h4>Depuration</h4><p>The centralized depuration system consists of a few large plants connected to domestic and industrial users by a sewer network.</p><a href=\"/en/purification\"><img alt=\"freccia\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/freccia.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><div class=\"settore\"><img alt=\"icona settore\" class=\"icona-settore\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/icona-recupero_1.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\" loading=\"lazy\"><h4>Retrieval</h4><p>Gida, being aware of owning the two main sources of \"recyclable\" water, has acquired a decisive role in the retrieval aimed at reusing wastewater.</p><a href=\"/en/retrieval\"><img alt=\"freccia\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/freccia_0.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><div class=\"settore\"><img alt=\"icona settore\" class=\"icona-settore\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/icona-trattamento.png\" width=\"99\" height=\"98\" loading=\"lazy\"><h4>Treatment</h4><p>The sewage treatment plant is located inside Calice and Baciacavallo purification plants and has been active since 1992.</p><a href=\"/en/liquid-waste-treatment-road\"><img alt=\"freccia\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/freccia_1.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"home-third-row-full-width__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-home-third-row-full-width\" class=\"region home_third_row_full_width\"><div id=\"it-block-homepercorsoacqua\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content4dfe11dd-5410-4144-baef-859d34fdc217\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><div class=\"wrapper-percorso\"><article class=\"back-percorso align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2022-01/back-percorso_1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"349\" alt=\"back percorso acqua\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article><div class=\"pulsante-percorso\"><div class=\"percorso-icona\"><img alt=\"icona acqua\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/icona-acqua_0.png\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"percorso-testo\"><a href=\"/sites/default/files/2024-10/GIDA%20FLYERWEB2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download the map with the water route</a></div><div class=\"percorso-freccia\"><img alt=\"freccia down\" src=\"/sites/default/files/inline-images/freccia-down.png\" width=\"14\" height=\"23\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"home-third-row__wrapper\"><div class=\"home-third-row container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col home-third-row__col home-third-row__first\"><div id=\"it-region-home-third-row-first\" class=\"region home_third_row_first\"><div id=\"it-block-homericerca\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-contenta18ca575-2879-4f80-a385-00419a4e60b1\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><div class=\"wrapper-ricerca\"><div class=\"testo-ricerca\"><h2>Education and research&nbsp;</h2><p>The company's commitment to research, study and experimentation is remarkable. Often the research is carried out in collaboration with external bodies, mainly university institutes, and is aimed at deepening more general and more properly scientific themes. GIDA experiments with new forms of reuse of purified water in the industrial, nursery and landscape sectors</p><a href=\"/en/research-and-education\"><article class=\"freccia align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2021-12/freccia.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" alt=\"freccia\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></a></div><article class=\"home-ricerca align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2021-12/home-ricerca.jpg\" width=\"513\" height=\"362\" alt=\"home ricerca\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"home-last-row-full-width__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-home-last-row-full-width\" class=\"region home_last_row_full_width\"><div id=\"it-block-homescuole\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content10924e2f-8c0f-4784-8843-82f4ad2cf374\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><div class=\"wrapper-scuola\"><div class=\"box-scuola\"><div class=\"testo-scuola\"><h2>Gida in schools</h2><h3><a href=\"/en/gida-scuole\">Request a guided tour of our structure</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p></div><article class=\"mascotte align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2021-12/mascotte.png\" width=\"252\" height=\"227\" alt=\"mascotte-gida\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div><article class=\"back-scuola align-center media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"><div class=\"field__label visually-hidden\">Image</div><div class=\"field__item\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2021-12/back-scuole.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"575\" alt=\"back-scuola\" class=\"img-fluid\"></div></div> </article></div></div></div></div></div>"
